    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive. Build. Share.\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive</strong> across multiple user generated maps, or build your own from scratch using the powerful and easy to use\u00a0<strong>World Editor</strong>. Share your creations with the community, explore tracks made by others, and prove your skills on a global scale thanks to asynchronous multiplayer and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.poster.avif?t=1754406777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.webm?t=1754406777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.mp4?t=1754406777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Driving Styles</strong>: Hand-made physics give each car its own personality and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World Editor</strong>: Create vast cities or tight circuits, from snowy landscapes to desert plains. Your imagination is the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Share your maps, explore cities made by others, and race across a constantly growing world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Racing Events</strong>: Compete in high-speed challenges with different car categories and climb the leaderboards against ghosts of friends and rivals.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Taxi Events</strong>: Pick up and drop off passengers in this fun, mission-based driving mode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Health Bar Mode</strong>: Survive tricky routes with limited health. Challenge your driving precision under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Police Chase Mode</strong>: Outrun the police and don\u2019t get caught.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blind Spot Mode</strong>: Drive as the world builds in real-time. Can you react fast enough?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>: Race against friends and rivals. Even if they\u2019re offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Progression</strong>: Climb the ranks, unlock new cars, and expand your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Watch your city come alive with dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Traffic System</strong>: Bring your maps to life with reactive AI traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Unlockables</strong>: Earn assets and make your creations truly one-of-a-kind. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive. Build. Share.\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive</strong> across multiple user generated maps, or build your own from scratch using the powerful and easy to use\u00a0<strong>World Editor</strong>. Share your creations with the community, explore tracks made by others, and prove your skills on a global scale thanks to asynchronous multiplayer and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.poster.avif?t=1754406777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.webm?t=1754406777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010100/extras/326b21bcf7762398bbf984724d42b112.mp4?t=1754406777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Driving Styles</strong>: Hand-made physics give each car its own personality and handling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>World Editor</strong>: Create vast cities or tight circuits, from snowy landscapes to desert plains. Your imagination is the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community Sharing</strong>: Share your maps, explore cities made by others, and race across a constantly growing world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Racing Events</strong>: Compete in high-speed challenges with different car categories and climb the leaderboards against ghosts of friends and rivals.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Taxi Events</strong>: Pick up and drop off passengers in this fun, mission-based driving mode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Health Bar Mode</strong>: Survive tricky routes with limited health. Challenge your driving precision under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Police Chase Mode</strong>: Outrun the police and don\u2019t get caught.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blind Spot Mode</strong>: Drive as the world builds in real-time. Can you react fast enough?\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous Multiplayer</strong>: Race against friends and rivals. Even if they\u2019re offline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Progression</strong>: Climb the ranks, unlock new cars, and expand your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong>: Watch your city come alive with dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Traffic System</strong>: Bring your maps to life with reactive AI traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Unlockables</strong>: Earn assets and make your creations truly one-of-a-kind. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A sandbox racing game with global leaderboards and an ever-growing collection of maps. Collect cars, race and explore, and when you're ready for a new challenge, build and share your own maps and circuits with players around the world.",
